WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:03,320
What's wrong? Someone is coming

2
00:00:03,320 --> 00:00:05,200
There are two teams below chasing people.

3
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:06,700
They chased

4
00:00:06,700 --> 00:00:11,730
There can't be only one person, right? They're coming. Let's run separately.

5
00:00:12,570 --> 00:00:13,880
There is another group of people in the northeast

6
00:00:13,880 --> 00:00:15,960
Please be careful not to go that way. Thank you.

7
00:00:24,520 --> 00:00:26,000
Your Majesty, if you don’t come down, I’ll shoot you.

8
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:27,480
Your Majesty, just a few dozen credits

9
00:00:27,480 --> 00:00:29,200
There's no need to do it to this level, right? It's so high.

10
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:30,360
It will really hurt if you fall

11
00:00:30,640 --> 00:00:32,600
Even the heavy rain didn't stop you from chasing me

12
00:00:32,880 --> 00:00:34,440
Now I'm afraid I'll get hurt

13
00:00:38,990 --> 00:00:39,990
You are also from Class S

14
00:00:41,140 --> 00:00:44,340
Don't confuse me with you young masters and ladies. What am I doing?

15
00:00:44,700 --> 00:00:45,620
That's our classmate

16
00:00:45,860 --> 00:00:48,330
Who are these who are also my credits?

17
00:00:48,730 --> 00:00:50,770
We were just scaring the prince, why is he aiming like this?

18
00:00:50,770 --> 00:00:51,730
Which class are you in?

19
00:00:51,890 --> 00:00:53,930
Your class also has extra points tasks and must-do tasks

20
00:00:54,410 --> 00:00:56,730
Each time a student from another class is eliminated, five points will be added

21
00:00:57,130 --> 00:00:58,610
Eliminate those who work more than mandatory shifts

22
00:00:58,610 --> 00:00:59,730
plus ten points
